  "case": "roundtrip-gemini",
  "covers": "R2-7 chain on the Gemini route: Anthropic request -> Responses -> chat request; chat stream (parallel calls, fragmented argument, thought signature) -> cache + Anthropic message (collected and streamed); tool_result replay -> next chat request with call ids, arguments and extra_content restored; final text reply",
  "family": "chat",
  "kind": "expect",
  "notes": [
    "metadata and replay_metadata come from emulated-metadata-lookup.jq, a reproduction of the bash cache lookup in prepare_chat; everything else is clai jq.",
    "Cross-checked: request, upstream_request and replay_upstream_request equal (jq -S) the bodies clai sent upstream in an instrumented bridge-api.sh run, and the cache entries equal its private cache files."
  ],
